  "Therapeutic indication": "Mysimba is indicated, as an adjunct to a reduced-calorie diet and increased physical activity, for the management of weight in adult patients (\u226518 years) with an initial Body Mass Index (BMI) of  \u2265 30 kg/m2 (obese), or \u2265 27 kg/m2 to &lt; 30 kg/m2 (overweight) in the presence of one or more weight-related co morbidities (e.g., type 2 diabetes, dyslipidaemia, or controlled hypertension)  Treatment with Mysimba should be discontinued after 16 weeks if patients have not lost at least 5% of their initial body weight.",
